  <revision rev="5" vrev="1">
    <srcmd5>ebf88d68eacd669a6b88bbf722c16902</srcmd5>
    <version>3.4.0</version>
    <time>1793020620</time>
    <user>dimstar_suse</user>
    <comment>- Update to 3.4.0:
  * Add support for Instrustar ISDS205A/B/X oscilloscopes
  * Add greater math modes; allow MATH scaling from 20 mV to 1000 V
  * Show oversampling factor on top of screen
  * Add persistent doNotTranslate option to bypass localisation;
    no UI translation for LANG=en_*
  * Remember save-as path for screenshots and exports; report an
    error when the screenshot or export file write fails
  * Fix voltage scale indices and channel calibration (ISDS205b)
  * Rename desktop file to org.openhantek.OpenHantek.desktop
  * Update user manual and translations; restructure includes,
    refactor build system and fix compiler warnings</comment>
    <requestid>1392676</requestid>
  </revision>
